content.text:
The library and search agent has also finished. On 1.1, 1.2 and 1.3 it:

- renamed about 90 layers;
- deleted the hidden titles under the search pill, plus an unused scrim;
- switched the edge tab colour to its design token.

The screens look the same as before. Every floating control already had glass. It also added glass to the small duration badge on video cards. That's a subtle change, and I'm happy to keep it if you are.

Still waiting on the item view agent (2.1–2.3), which is the one adding the glass title pill.

