docs/changelog.md:135:- The README mascot's body now moves exactly like the sidebar mascot's. It was running a separate copy of the sidebar drift with every period snapped to a divisor of 24 so the state would close on itself, which made the silhouette recur every 12s while the body took twice as long to come round. The loop never needed that — an SVG keyframe track already interpolates its last keyframe to the opening one — so both states now share one body (`inkling-drift-faced`) and the loop closes where it always was. The gaze wander stops being a second hand-rolled copy of `liveliness` for the same reason (`src/components/mascot/bot/states.ts`, `src/components/mascot/readmeMascot.ts`, `docs/assets/mascots/inkling-splash-loop.svg`)
